Z||000006||elfiero||08-07-2000||10:18 AM||||I've done two seriesI 3800 fiero swaps and<BR>presently working on a S/C3800 swap in my<BR>spare time the wiring isnt that difficult<BR>I reccomend you get a factory wiring diagram<BR>for the engine and one for the car.If you<BR>have questions,email me and we can talk.Its<BR>not that tough of a swap-go for it!||||reg||10
